WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.933
Hi there!
I’m Mismo.

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:04.433
I’m a sniffer dog
for French Customs.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.566
It’s a cool job:
I get to fight the bad guys

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.600
who try to smuggle all sorts of stuff
across the border,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.366
and I have colleagues across the EU
doing the same thing.

00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:18.800
Together, we make sure
that illegal things don’t get into Europe.

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:21.833
Sometimes we have to work
in rough conditions,

00:00:21.966 --> 00:00:23.833
but actually...
we love it !

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.033
People know us because we’re good
at detecting illegal drugs,

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:30.433
explosives and large
amounts of cash.

00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:34.000
But we are also trained to find
forbidden food, or ivory.

00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:37.233
Oh...hang on...
I think I smell something!

00:00:37.733 --> 00:00:39.066
Got to follow
my nose!

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.266
Ah ha!
Found it!

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.000
Oh, by the way,
let me introduce Newton!

00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:48.466
He’s not trained yet, but soon,
he’ll be a great partner

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:51.566
and together, we’ll help
protect the EU borders.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.133
It’s a dog’s life...

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.633
and we love it!

